---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for DevToolsHub."
>
  <section class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: June 19, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This website ("DevToolsHub") respects your privacy. This policy explains
      what data is collected and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its
      partners use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this
      site and other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized
      advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based
      on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site may use analytics tools to understand how visitors use the
      site. This data is aggregated and does not personally identify you.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us via the
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 3rem auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
  .page h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .page p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
  }
</style>